## negTestCheckLiteral (let)
<ω> Num [| λ(st: State) -> λ(v: Num) -> FFI.$eq v 1 |]

## negFnApp (let)
<ω> Num [| λ(st: State) -> λ(v: Num) -> FFI.$eq v 0 |]

## negTestCheckLambdaPreAndPostCondition (let)
Π(n: <ω> Num [| λ(st: State) -> λ(n: Num) -> FFI.$gt n 0 |]) ->
  <ω> Num [| λ(st: State) -> λ(n: Num) -> FFI.$gt n 0 |]
